<title>USA: DSP holders approve 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>DSP holders approve 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>CUPERTINO, Calif. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>DSP Communications Inc said Tuesday its shareholders approved a two-for-one stock split authorized by its board of directors in September.</p>
<p>The record date for the split is November 13, with the distribution of the new share certificates expected on December 2, the software company said in a statement.</p>
